ere runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, across 6 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value got 34% of normal in January to February and 181% in July to August. Grid 25935 had its driest year in 1976 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
